Package: com.hesper.nocablewarn
Name: No Cable Warn
Version: 1.0-2
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: Hesper <hesperup@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Description: Suppress the unsupported-charging-accessory alert on iOS 10
 Hooks SpringBoard so the flag behind the "This accessory may not be
 supported" (可能不支持此配件) alert never gets set. Charging itself is
 unaffected (that is hardware-level).
